petrus-execution
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of Petrus's provider-neutral execution
territories (petrus.motus execution): the archive codec and the Local,
Docker, E2B and Gondolin providers from Petrus
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus), pinned under upstream/petrus
(see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root). It reproduces the observable
behaviour of that reference, and its test suite ports the reference's tests
and runs differential checks against it.

File copied unmodified from the reference and run as it is:
data/gondolin_sidecar.mjs (upstream
src/petrus/motus/_execution/gondolin_sidecar.mjs).

